  "description": "*\"I never imagined being here and doing this with you.”*\n\nShim Woo-Jin was Kwon Kyung’s sunbae back in high school. 12 years later, they reunite at Woo-Jin's best friend’s wedding…who just so happens to also be Kyung's first love. Kyung always thought of Woo-Jin as his rival in the race for his best friend’s affection; but as the two of them find themselves reconnecting at an after-party all alone, their conversation isn’t the only things that grows deeper and deeper… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes prologue and one side story chapter.*",
